From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mips: ingenic: drop SCACHE from the T41 machine

The T41 stops before the early console in QEMU. Try the machine
without MIPS_CPU_SCACHE so the early cache setup is not the hang.
T31/T20 keep the SCACHE.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
--- a/arch/mips/ingenic/Kconfig
+++ b/arch/mips/ingenic/Kconfig
@@ -107,7 +107,6 @@
 
 config MACH_T41
 	bool
-	select MIPS_CPU_SCACHE
 	select SYS_HAS_CPU_MIPS32_R2
 	select SYS_SUPPORTS_HIGHMEM
 
